TI  - Efficient Neural Network Pruning Using Model-Based Reinforcement Learning
PY  - 2022
T2  - Proceedings - International Symposium on Measurement and Control in Robotics: Robotics and Virtual Tools for a New Era, ISMCR 2022
DO  - 10.1109/ISMCR56534.2022.9950598
