TI  - Enhancing Robot Safety and Reducing Motion Noise: Reward Function Optimization in Reinforcement Learning for Quadruped/Humanoid Robots
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 6th International Conference on Computer, Control and Robotics (ICCCR)
SP  - 456
